# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This MVP runs entirely on local data (localStorage + seed JSON in src/data).
# No environment variables are required to run it. The variables below are
# placeholders for future integrations described in README.md — uncomment and
# fill them in only once you actually wire up that integration.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Gmail / Google Calendar — base URL of the deployed xoxo-integrations
# Cloudflare Worker (see worker/ and INTEGRATIONS_SETUP.md). Leave unset for
# local dev with integrations off; set it to test against a deployed Worker,
# e.g. VITE_INTEGRATIONS_API_URL=https://xoxo-integrations.<subdomain>.workers.dev
# VITE_INTEGRATIONS_API_URL=

# VITE_GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID=

# VITE_META_APP_ID=
# VITE_META_APP_SECRET=

# VITE_LINKEDIN_CLIENT_ID=
# VITE_LINKEDIN_CLIENT_SECRET=

# VITE_TIKTOK_CLIENT_KEY=

# VITE_CALENDLY_API_KEY=

# VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
